    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Short messages and time markers",
     "texto": [
      "In everyday SMS or app messages, essential time markers are very common: «om half zes» (at 17:30), «iets later» (a little later) and «tot straks» (see you soon / see you in a while). The separable verb «meenemen» means to take along: «Neem je blauwe tas mee» (bring your blue bag)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
